# Api adapter

Override generated `*ServiceBase`. Send a MediatR request with `context.CancellationToken`. No validation, mapping, or EF in the adapter.

Event handlers send a MediatR command the same way. Always `async Task` and `await` Send. Do not return the Task un-awaited.

```csharp
public override async Task<CreatePageResponse> CreatePage(
    CreatePageRequest request,
    ServerCallContext context) =>
    await mediator.Send(new CreatePageCommand(request), context.CancellationToken);

public async Task Handle(ItemChangedEvent evt, CancellationToken cancellationToken) =>
    await mediator.Send(new ApplyItemChanged(evt), cancellationToken);
```
